# COBOL MCS Teleprocessing Strategy
# Prioritizes telecommunication queue segments over background routines.

DATA DIVISION.
01 SEGMENT-FLAG PIC 9 USAGE R0.
01 STATUS-OK    PIC 9 USAGE R1.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 1 TO SEGMENT-FLAG.
    MOVE 1 TO STATUS-OK.
    
    IF SEGMENT-FLAG == STATUS-OK
        SET depth 6.
        # Set high weight for input event queue keycode
        WEIGHT 32 8.
    ELSE
        SET depth 2.
    END-IF.
    
    EVAL.
